# touches. The shared sources/ and reports/ churn from concurrent dev work (review
# notes, source summaries) — watching them for "new stray files" false-positives every
# time another session writes there during a run (live-smoke fail 2026-06-21). Owning
# our own dirs makes the §8 stray-file tripwire meaningful: any unexpected file HERE is
# genuinely an agent escaping its sandbox, not unrelated KB activity.
